<section class="page-intro"><a href="/" class="breadcrumb">Home / Our world</a><span class="eyebrow">Mavoi</span><h1>A world of details.<br/><em>Make it personal.</em></h1><p>A new perspective on everyday.</p></section><section class="fashion-story about-story"><div class="fashion-story-photo"><img src="@Shop.Settings.Story" alt="The collection of Mavoi" width="900" height="1200"/></div><div class="fashion-story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT US</span><h2>Get to know<br/><em>the collection.</em></h2><p>Explore the collection at your own pace. Save the details you love and bring your sizing, colour and delivery questions to the team.</p><p>See it. Say it. Wear it. Discover Mavoi’s photographed collection, save what speaks to you and ask about sizing or your next visit. Visit the boutique in Zalka or ask the team about delivery across Lebanon.</p><a class="button" href="/shop">Explore the collection ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="@Shop.Settings.Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit our Instagram ↗</a></div></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Your own way to explore.</h2><p>Discover the photographed looks, keep a list of favourites and send a personal enquiry. Colours, sizing, availability and ordering details are confirmed directly with the team.</p><a class="text-link" href="/lookbook">Open the visual diary ↗</a></section>
